I reach my flat.
Now there is no heavy rain.
A light wind blows.
I open the door.
I go inside.
I walk straight to the window.
I open the window.
A nice cold breeze comes inside.
During the day, it was very hot.
Now that heat is completely gone.
It is nice and cold in the room.
I look outside.
There is water all over the road.
It will rain in the night too.
I like this weather very much.
I stand there for some time.
This evening is very beautiful.
This day ends peacefully here.
